/* The app's string catalogue. Values here are the source of every user-facing sentence the
   setup window draws; the window reads them through `localized(_:)` and never holds one in a
   stored property, because a value captured at build time keeps the language it was built in.

   Twelve of these are quoted verbatim by README.md, install.sh and issue #20 — changing one
   of those means changing the documents in the same commit. Item 23 turns that pairing into a
   registry a test can enforce.

   What is deliberately **not** here: `testCommand`, which is shell syntax rather than a
   message and is typed `ShellPayload` so a catalogue value cannot reach it. */

