"app.section.accessibility.help" = "Used to confirm on Warp's screen that claude received the input. Without it, buttons that schedule claude input are refused without opening a tab — all three shipped presets are in that group, because a ! input only runs when it is typed into claude's shell mode. Buttons with no claude input, and buttons that schedule a single plain line, work without the permission. While a delivery is running you have to keep that tab in view.";
